  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Final&nbsp;density of diatomic gas is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></p><p>Final pressure is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></math></p><p>In adiabatic process, equation of state is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>constant</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math>&nbsp;is the volume,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is the pressure and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is the ratio of specific heat of diatomic gas</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>&#961;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#947;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>constant</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>&#961;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>and mass is constant, then the&nbsp;pressure is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#947;</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>32</mn><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>32</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn></math></p>",
